# Keep the Docker build context small & reproducible.
# Anything listed here is NOT sent to the Docker daemon / used by COPY.

# Dependencies (reinstalled inside the build stage)
**/node_modules

# Rust / Tauri desktop build output (can be several GB)
apps/web/src-tauri/target
apps/web/dist
**/dist
**/.turbo

# VCS & tooling state
.git
.github
.omc
.vscode
.idea

# Build artifacts & local binaries
**/*.exe
**/*.msi
**/.deploytest

# Env & secrets — never bake these into an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Logs & OS cruft
**/*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
